1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,480
An ancient Indian mathematician sits under a tree writing
numbers on palm leaves.

2
00:00:05,480 --> 00:00:10,539
He discovers the concept of zero and draws a circle to
represent nothing.

3
00:00:10,539 --> 00:00:16,329
The mathematician shows how zero makes calculations much
easier and more accurate.

4
00:00:16,329 --> 00:00:21,170
He teaches his students about place value using the decimal
system.

5
00:00:21,170 --> 00:00:26,160
The students practice writing large numbers using the new
zero symbol.

6
00:00:26,160 --> 00:00:32,969
The mathematician explains how this discovery will help
future generations solve complex problems.
